sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Candidat
    participant UI as Interface UI
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant A as Agent IA (Analyse)
    participant DB as MongoDB

    C->>UI: Déposer CV
    UI->>G: POST /upload_cv
    G->>A: cv_agent.process_cv()
    activate A
    A->>A: Extraction & Scoring
    A->>DB: Sauvegarder Profil
    DB-->>A: Confirmation
    A-->>G: Retourne Score
    deactivate A
    G-->>UI: Confirmation & Données
    UI-->>C: Affiche le Score de Qualité
